('advanced-native-1875', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1875-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["在這三隊的完結時間比較中，晚班隊受交通限制最大。"],"options":["在這三隊的完結時間比較中，晚班隊受交通限制最大。","晚班隊只是最不願合作，沒有實際時間限制。","三隊的交通與時間完全相同，沒有比較基礎。","晚班隊已取消所有工作，沒有需要協議的安排。"]},"advanced-native-1875-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Their constraint was less flexible, so a common timetable could affect them differently.","It had the least room to manoeuvre because its transport ended at ten.","The other teams could move their finishing times more easily.","A later finish would create a transport problem that the others did not face in the same way."],"options":["Their constraint was less flexible, so a common timetable could affect them differently.","It had the least room to manoeuvre because its transport ended at ten.","The other teams could move their finishing times more easily.","A later finish would create a transport problem that the others did not face in the same way."]},"advanced-native-1875-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Among these partners, the person arranging childcare has the least room to manoeuvre over meeting times."],"options":["Fewer available times establish that this person values the project less than the others.","Having a constraint means this person cannot be asked about any possible alternative.","Among these partners, the person arranging childcare has the least room to manoeuvre over meeting times."]},"advanced-native-1875-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["這人必然最不合作，所以不用了解原因。"],"options":["在明確比較範圍內，調整自由較其他人少。","這人必然最不合作，所以不用了解原因。","仍需知道限制屬於時間、資源還是其他方面。"]},"advanced-native-1875-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The crew with the least room to manoeuvre may face a different cost from the same finishing time; let’s ask what alternatives are actually possible."],"options":["I would take a limited choice of times as evidence that the crew prefers not to join.","The crew with the least room to manoeuvre may face a different cost from the same finishing time; let’s ask