aranteed a lasting role.","I thought I had been offered a lasting role, rather than only this short introduction."]},"advanced-native-1892-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Thank you for giving me a foot in the door through the design discussion; I now have a clearer idea of what I need to learn. Would it be appropriate to send one question about the model-making process after I review my notes?","That introduction was a foot in the door, not a team position, and I value the chance to see the work being discussed. Could I ask a brief follow-up about the materials when I have read the notes carefully?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
