('advanced-native-2026', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-2026-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The process and responsibilities had become unclear, but a closure had not been announced."],"options":["The workshop had announced permanent closure and cancelled the opening rota.","The old rota still fully explained the revised booking process.","The members had already agreed new opening responsibilities before the change.","The process and responsibilities had become unclear, but a closure had not been announced."]},"advanced-native-2026-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We still needed to know who would take the new opening responsibilities.","The booking change affected how we could rely on the existing rota.","The ground was shifting under our feet because the old rota no longer clarified who would open the room.","A familiar arrangement no longer answered an important practical question."],"options":["We still needed to know who would take the new opening responsibilities.","The booking change affected how we could rely on the existing rota.","The ground was shifting under our feet because the old rota no longer clarified who would open the room.","A familiar arrangement no longer answered an important practical question."]},"advanced-native-2026-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The ground is shifting under their feet as the familiar submission categories change, while the final rules remain unsettled."],"options":["The discussion establishes that the publication has already stopped accepting any work permanently.","The writers are following settled rules that have remained unchanged throughout.","The ground is shifting under their feet as the familiar submission categories change, while the final rules remain unsettled."]},"advanced-native-2026-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The final outcome has already been confirmed as the loss of their roles."],"options":["More detail is needed to identify which conditions are changing.","They experience a